          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Anthropic Launches Claude Security Enterprise Tool — Falls Short of Mythos-Level Capabilities",
            "articleSection": "Policy & Rights",
            "abstract": "Anthropic has launched Claude Security, an AI-powered vulnerability scanner built on its Opus 4.7 model, aimed at enterprise customers seeking automated cybersecurity tools. The product was released weeks after the Mythos zero-day threat triggered global alarm, but Anthropic has confirmed it does not carry Mythos-level offensive capabilities. Indian enterprises and CERT-In had been assessing exposure risks from Mythos, making this product launch directly relevant to India's cybersecurity posture.",
            "url": "https://www.medianama.com/2026/05/223-anthropics-claude-security-amid-mythos-concerns/",
            "publisher": {
              "@type": "NewsMediaOrganization",
              "name": "The AI Chronicle",
